SLAUGHTERZONE!

IN THE NAME OF THE LIBERATION PARTY THAT HAS RECENTLY RETURNED
INDIA TO THE PEOPLE, ELEMENTS OF THE 33RD TANK GUARDS OF RUSSIA 
HAVE JOINED IN OUR EFFORTS TO DEFEND AGAINST OUTSIDE INVADERS.

AFTER SEVERAL DAYS OF BORDER CLASHES, 1ST TROOP OF THE 33RD
GUARDS HAS BEEN GIVEN ITS FIRST MISSION ORDERS. 

YOUR INITIAL COURSE HEADING IS 036ø NORTH BY NORTH EAST. 

1ST TROOP'S MISSION OBJECTIVE IS TO FIND AND NEUTRALIZE THE 
FORWARD BASE THE MULTILATERAL FORCE (MLF) INVADERS HAVE ATTEMPTED 
TO ESTABLISH IN THIS QUADRANT. THIS IS TO INCLUDE ALL PATROLLING 
MBT/IFVS AS WELL AS ALL ARTILLERY EMPLACEMENTS. 


